{"author":{"id":"746a4d30afc20b78119cb8ed7c194f988174fc252f0e9d9eb92022244ef86db3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1780618743,"nonce":"pdrcBNwKW8D+fZ/jUnNMhBQsFQE=","metadata":{"github-id":"I_kwDOK4fCvM8AAAABEcTBLg","github-url":"https://github.com/rolker/unh_echoboats_project11/issues/217","origin":"github"},"title":"Forward USB camera: black frames — perception_launch.py requests unsupported 640×360 (device is 640×480)","message":"## Summary\n\nThe forward **USB camera produces all-black frames** because the launch file requests a\nresolution the device doesn't offer. Root-caused on the 2026-06-03 deployment (#211); fix is\na one-liner.\n\n## Root cause\n\n`bizzyboat_project11/launch/perception_launch.py:115` hardcodes `'image_height': 360`. The\ndevice (\"HD USB Camera\", uvcvideo) offers MJPG at 1920×1080 / 1280×720 / 1024×768 / **640×480**\n/ 800×600 / 1280×1024 / 320×240 — **no 640×360**. The driver starts at 640×360 (unsupported), the\ndevice delivers 640×480, the size mismatch makes `mjpeg2rgb` yield all-zero (black) buffers.\n\n**Fix:** `perception_launch.py` `image_height` **360 → 480** (640×480 is supported; width 640 is\nfine). Requires a camera/launch **restart** to re-open the device.\n\n## Side faults found same session (lower priority, same camera)\n\n1. **`ffmpeg/libx264` transport won't initialize** on the USB cam — repeating\n   `cannot open codec libx264 / cannot initialize encoder`. OAK encoders are fine; only the USB\n   cam's. Working transports: raw `image_raw`, `compressed`, `zstd`.\n2. **`compressedDepth` advertised on a color image** — a naive viewer (e.g. the rqt image grid,\n   which enumerates all transports) hits the broken ffmpeg and/or compressedDepth-on-color and\n   can crash. Workaround: pin the transport to `compressed`.\n\nSide-finding: a sibling `izzyboat_project11/` dir holds correct `camera_forward_640_480.yaml` /\n`camera_forward.yaml` (1920×1080) that bizzy's launch doesn't use — worth a glance for a\npossible stray/duplicate.\n\nPart of rolker/unh_echoboats_project11#211 (deployment wrap-up). Source: gabby field log\n`docs/logs/2026/2026-06-03_gabby_logs.md` (15:33 entry).\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.8`","files":null}]}